  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focused contribution to health systems strengthening through support for human resources for health in Tete province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned intervention follows a previous funding package for Human Resources for Health (HRH), the Integrated Network/Rede Integrada project and the Primary Health Care (PHC) and Capacity Building project, whereby the Rede Integrada comprised 4 separate parts implemented by the DPS, Institute of Tropical Medicine (Antwerp) (ITM), International Centre for Reproductive Health (ICRH) and M&#xe9;decins sans Fronti&#xe8;res (MSF). On national level FICA participates in the SWAp and has been channeling funds through the common fund Prosa&#xfa;de, supported by 12 bilateral and multilateral donors.</narrative>
  </description>
